---
title: Visual Artifact Subsystem
---
flowchart TB
    User([User]) --> UI[Chat and artifact UI]
    UI --> API[Owned visual APIs]
    MCP([Confirmed local MCP call]) -.-> API
    API --> Ownership[Ownership, limits<br/>and integrity checks]

    subgraph Capabilities[Visual capabilities]
        Diagram[DiagramAgent]
        Image{New image<br/>or source edit?}
        Vision[Image analysis<br/>and follow-up]
        Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapters]
    end

    Ownership --> Diagram
    Ownership --> Image
    Ownership --> Vision

    Diagram --> Inference
    Vision --> Inference
    Inference -->|diagram role| Qwen[Qwen 3.5 4B via vLLM]
    Inference -->|vision role| Qwen
    Qwen --> Mermaid[Validated Mermaid]
    Image -->|new| HiDream[HiDream via ComfyUI]
    Image -->|edit| Flux[FLUX.2 Klein via ComfyUI]
    HiDream --> Pixels[Validated image bytes]
    Flux --> Pixels

    Qwen --> Analysis[Grounded analysis<br/>or threaded answer]

    Mermaid --> Repository[Owned artifact repository]
    Pixels --> Repository
    Analysis --> Repository
    Repository --> Storage[(PostgreSQL metadata and lineage<br/>opaque private files)]
    Pixels --> VisionEmbed[Nomic vision embedding]
    VisionEmbed --> Storage

    Repository --> UI

